            "review_title": "Review at Oc 66",
            "review_text": "Ali921\nEdinburgh, United Kingdom1707 contributions\n0\nSuperb food\nNov 2022\nHad some incredible dishes here. Specialises in snails, oysters and crab but you can get many other sort as well. Our choices included the above plus quail eggs. A great find recommended by our local guide. Not a tourist in sight.\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten November 29, 2022",
